{
  "schema_version": 2,
  "diagram_type": "workflow",
  "meta": {
    "title": "eBPF 分支：启动、采集与 Prometheus 抓取",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "animation": "none",
    "quality_profile": "showcase",
    "views": [
      {
        "id": "startup-attachment",
        "label": "启动挂载",
        "focus": [
          "start",
          "load",
          "attach"
        ],
        "note": "解析 --iface 与 --addr，加载 BPF objects，再创建 clsact 并挂载 ingress/egress filters。"
      },
      {
        "id": "packet-update",
        "label": "数据包计数",
        "focus": [
          "attach",
          "packet",
          "map"
        ],
        "note": "IPv4 数据包经过 TC handler，以 src_ip、dst_ip、direction 为键更新 traffic_stats。"
      },
      {
        "id": "packet-guards",
        "label": "跳过不支持的数据包",
        "focus": [
          "packet",
          "skip"
        ],
        "note": "Ethernet/IP 头越界或非 IPv4 数据包直接返回 TC_ACT_OK，不统计也不阻断数据包。"
      },
      {
        "id": "scrape-samples",
        "label": "抓取与导出",
        "focus": [
          "map",
          "scrape",
          "collect",
          "metrics",
          "prom"
        ],
        "note": "Map 保存累计值，Prometheus 的 GET /metrics 独立触发 Collector 读取并返回样本；抓取本身不清空 Map。"
      }
    ],
    "output": "artifacts/archify/ebpf-workflow.html"
  },
  "lanes": [
    {
      "id": "startup",
      "label": "加载与挂载"
    },
    {
